---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | ShipToCash">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ink-900 mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose">
    <p><em>Last updated: November 2, 2026</em></p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>
      ShipToCash does not offer user accounts or a purchase checkout on this site.
      Pages are hosted by Cloudflare, which may process request information such as IP
      addresses, request times, and browser information to deliver and protect the site.
      See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a>.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Analytics</strong> — no Google Analytics measurement ID is configured in the current site.</li>
      <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — the Google loader is included for the advertising integration; site review and ad availability are separate. Google may process device and request information and, where permitted, use cookies to serve ads. You can opt out of personalized advertising at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits
      to this and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners
      to serve ads based on your browsing. You may opt out via
      <a href="https://adssettings.google.com">Ads Settings</a> or
      <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/">aboutads.info/choices</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Local settings and calculators</h2>
    <p>
      The cookie banner stores your selection in browser local storage under
      <code>cookie-consent-v1</code>. The fee calculator runs in the browser; this site
      does not submit the amounts you enter to a calculation service. You can clear
      local site data through your browser settings to remove the saved consent choice.
      A consent-mode signal does not prevent every request to Google or replace any
      consent platform required by Google for ad serving in your region.
    </p>
    <h2>Messages and external links</h2>
    <p>
      If you contact the author through GitHub, GitHub processes the message under its
      own privacy policy. External checkout and provider links are operated by those
      services. Avoid including private payment or account information in public messages.
    </p>
    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      Some articles contain affiliate links. If you purchase through them, we may earn a
      commission at no extra cost to you. Paid relationships should be disclosed near the relevant link. A provider link does not by itself mean that a product was purchased or tested.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy: reach me on
      <a
        href="https://github.com/zhoupeng20188"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline">GitHub</a>,
      or through the <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline">contact page</a>.
    </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
